  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Moisture Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/Ben_10_-_Water_Hazard_absorbs_moisture.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250701024140\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ben 10 - Water Hazard absorbs moisture\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/Ben_10_-_Water_Hazard_absorbs_moisture.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20250701024140\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/Ben_10_-_Water_Hazard_absorbs_moisture.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20250701024140 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/Ben_10_-_Water_Hazard_absorbs_moisture.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250701024140 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Ben 10 - Water Hazard absorbs moisture\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Ben_10_-_Water_Hazard_absorbs_moisture.gif\" data-image-name=\"Ben 10 - Water Hazard absorbs moisture.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Water Hazard (Ben 10) can absorb moisture from the air through the openings on his palms.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb moisture.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"First, some nice cold water! Then, I'll absorb the moisture from the air!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Waterhazard (Ben 10)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb moisture and utilize it in some way</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Liquid_Manipulation\" title=\"Liquid Manipulation\">Liquid Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Absorption\" title=\"Water Absorption\">Water Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb moisture in all its forms from the atmosphere, bodies of living creatures, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dehydration\" title=\"Dehydration\">Dehydration</a> when used on living beings.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Enhanced_Condition\" title=\"Elemental Enhanced Condition\">Elemental Enhanced Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Regeneration\" title=\"Elemental Regeneration\">Elemental Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Liquid_Empowerment\" title=\"Liquid Empowerment\">Liquid Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Elemental Absorption\">Elemental Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Negation\" title=\"Elemental Negation\">Elemental Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Liquid_Manipulation\" title=\"Liquid Manipulation\">Liquid Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Liquid_Mimicry\" title=\"Liquid Mimicry\">Liquid Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Absorption\" title=\"Water Absorption\">Water Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May not be able to control the absorption.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Orishans (<i>Ben 10</i>)\n<ul><li>Water Hazard</li></ul></li>\n<li>Eliade (<i>D.Gray-Man</i>)</li>\n<li>The Indigestible Wad (<i>The Ripping Friends</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMoisture_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"6621fedd02c9a4b8c157c88d573a6f41\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:125px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eliade-s_Bubbles-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:123px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Eliade%27s_Bubbles.png\" title=\"Eliade&#39;s Bubbles.png (253 KB)\" style=\"height:123px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Eliade%27s_Bubbles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150616210322\" title=\"Eliade&#039;s Bubbles.png (253 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Eliade (D.Gray-Man) producing vast quantities of bubbles that absorb moisture from everything they hit, leaving them dried up husks.\" height=\"123\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eliade&#039;s Bubbles.png\" data-image-key=\"Eliade%27s_Bubbles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Eliade (D.Gray-Man) producing vast quantities of bubbles that absorb moisture from everything they hit, leaving them dried up husks.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Eliade&#39;s Bubbles.png (253 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Eliade (D.Gray-Man) producing vast quantities of bubbles that absorb moisture from everything they hit, leaving them dried up husks.\" height=\"123\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Eliade&#39;s Bubbles.png\" data-image-key=\"Eliade%27s_Bubbles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Eliade (D.Gray-Man) producing vast quantities of bubbles that absorb moisture from everything they hit, leaving them dried up husks.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Eliade%27s_Bubbles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150616210322\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Eliade (D.Gray-Man) producing vast quantities of bubbles that absorb moisture from everything they hit, leaving them dried up husks.</div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802152436\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 221/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 222/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2321/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.946      1 -total\n 87.86%   12.253      1 Template:Infobox\n 11.26%    1.571      1 Template:Quote\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:413246-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802152436 and revision id 2742969. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
